# The a11y-fixer-pro license SIGNING key (PKCS8 PEM, Ed25519).
#
# This MUST be the production private key whose public half is embedded in the
# GitHub Action (packages/github-action/src/license.ts). Any other key produces
# trial tokens the Action rejects. Keep it secret — never commit the real value.
#
# Local dev: copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and paste the PEM.
# Vercel: set LICENSE_SIGNING_KEY in Project Settings → Environment Variables
# for Production and Preview.
#
# Multi-line PEM: wrap the whole value in quotes, e.g.
# LICENSE_SIGNING_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----
# ...
# -----END PRIVATE KEY-----"
LICENSE_SIGNING_KEY=
